Package: d3poindia
Title: BharatViz: India State Context Maps
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Rahul",
           family = "Shukla",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "rahulshuklakrc@gmail.com")
Description: BharatViz visualises published, aggregate state-level indicators for
    India (National Family Health Survey, NFHS-5) as descriptive regional context.
    It ships no microdata. Part of the Growth & Work Atlas; the India panel is
    descriptive context and is not joined to any industry, wage, or productivity
    measure. Built with the D3po framework.
